            <div xml:id="m-2b7f1ef0-694e-4ba8-bb48-f640d2912b1a">
              <lg xml:id="m-0857fd6c-1ef4-4d76-ae5e-3a47a5014010">
                <l xml:id="m-9ac0c847-6148-4d7a-985a-0bd20cbf6bfe" facs="#m-7444df31-1b22-4f3e-92bf-f0aa2b8fbdbe" label="ambiguous">882</l><l xml:id="m-8272a104-5faa-49c6-a23b-ee3d388f1013" facs="#m-b5a97ba3-31d4-4a7b-a4ba-f7a78631a3a9" label="text-like">Whit Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-183e8796-3add-4723-99e5-1fc0446b44bc" facs="#m-f15301aa-74be-4c0e-ac01-ed46682c1143" label="ambiguous">† Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Joannem. Joann. c</l><l xml:id="m-72429cc0-9b9e-46ec-b30b-34def69df032" facs="#m-2d5df7a3-196c-43fd-a821-bcfcfb455c4e" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Dixit Jesus disci-]meam do vobis: non quómodo</l><l xml:id="m-2849b0d9-b68b-48fd-b9ba-39162b19baec" facs="#m-a5446ca1-776c-4453-b19f-bdfaf31b5591" label="ambiguous">A pulis suis: Si quis diligit me,</l><l xml:id="m-115c0b46-f778-4459-bd85-c4306fd89cc2" facs="#m-216daa76-136f-4566-8057-6d0c98c8ec87" label="ambiguous">mundus dat, ego do vobis. Non tur¬</l><l xml:id="m-0cd91123-e25b-45e5-b8d0-89e5ab741f45" facs="#m-d8e28d9b-a0ee-4769-90e6-96e35238ba49" label="lyrics-like">sermônem meum servábit, et Pater</l><l xml:id="m-c27cd5ac-3d67-48ad-af1b-539c60530d4d" facs="#m-1d238c31-1ca5-49db-aa9b-3aa359c54825" label="lyrics-like">bétur cor vestrum, neque formídet.</l><l xml:id="m-4716ee13-df9a-47b7-9619-d849977e9e55" facs="#m-00925de2-9160-4467-9acd-946edbafaaa9" label="ambiguous">Audistis quia ego dixi vobis: Vado,</l><l xml:id="m-c70b1d39-2b87-423d-8ee8-80af15748966" facs="#m-9e01bd13-ee5e-41ee-aa99-d0679a6d50f4" label="lyrics-like">meus díliget eum, et ad eum venié¬</l><l xml:id="m-24ead30b-4427-4b81-9078-50b31cce5b56" facs="#m-5e4dde7e-0565-42c9-bfd4-06576f411614" label="lyrics-like">mus, et mansiónem apud eum fa¬</l><l xml:id="m-15d27af2-80a9-48de-83bb-267a7a588ccf" facs="#m-ec227baf-8ee9-4ae3-a17a-4df38195117c" label="lyrics-like">et vénio ad vos. Si diligerétis me,</l><l xml:id="m-1080832a-1bfe-4a47-878e-51fe6fb1990c" facs="#m-7ae75411-830f-44e0-97e6-7ec43e86508b" label="lyrics-like">ciémus: qui non diligit me, sermó¬</l><l xml:id="m-f3cd9800-a008-486c-b522-8333f446ec39" facs="#m-0d26976b-92af-4ab4-9566-dd1edbcfc28e" label="lyrics-like">gauderétis útique, quia vado ad</l><l xml:id="m-bc988423-f686-4213-a260-c6b1bf4ab50d" facs="#m-6d51186e-04e4-4edd-8ece-5a0999a65a66" label="lyrics-like">nes meos non servat. Et sermónem</l><l xml:id="m-90674b5c-000b-4939-acd7-4005a333f399" facs="#m-ccffdbe3-919c-4db8-a1b5-1c9a2bc9fdbc" label="ambiguous">Patrem; quia Pater maior me est.</l><l xml:id="m-391220d5-37fe-42bf-bac1-e896a591a089" facs="#m-d06cc373-1466-4229-a364-83aaf5a815d6" label="lyrics-like">quem audístis, non est meus; sed</l><l xml:id="m-acabbb54-e32b-44ca-9fb9-050a92338819" facs="#m-d00ef910-1df3-44cc-8afa-7dd8faca97ad" label="lyrics-like">Et nunc dixi vobis priúsquam fiat:</l><l xml:id="m-44d06941-e973-4231-978b-7075b0e966ae" facs="#m-60b6ab1a-beba-4892-84e3-f29876492267" label="ambiguous">ejus, qui misit me, Patris. Haec</l><l xml:id="m-f893c32a-2b84-4f07-a98c-c9ef7eb6a3a4" facs="#m-40282395-88bf-46e1-9fb2-ea2618f84997" label="lyrics-like">ut cum factum fúerit, credátis. Jam</l><l xml:id="m-c17e3a27-ede1-405b-9767-49d9fc703a6a" facs="#m-0aaa9b68-9dcd-488d-9bfc-ab15e9f383a8" label="lyrics-like">locútus sum vobis, apud vos manens.</l><l xml:id="m-926d7fcf-d983-4ff9-89a2-f7861be91b39" facs="#m-7c3cac65-b1f8-4c6d-acea-9be490036dbf" label="lyrics-like">non multa loquar vobíscum. Venit</l><l xml:id="m-ec30575e-6ba1-4869-9f15-4f7ca02a1c86" facs="#m-f8972976-378a-44db-8af6-7d67807c3c15" label="lyrics-like">Paráclitus autem Spiritus Sanctus,</l><l xml:id="m-86a55013-0ed2-4b73-a183-72418f9e36bb" facs="#m-fbf66bef-e990-41eb-a3b4-639e02900ca9" label="ambiguous">enim princeps mundi hujus, et in me</l><l xml:id="m-1c76b4ea-4b3d-44e6-9d09-de95aebc7979" facs="#m-9b405261-4460-417d-aa7c-bd83fffbd5db" label="lyrics-like">non habet quidquam. Sed ut cognó¬</l><l xml:id="m-0d432bad-6476-4d79-8eda-7935dceb307c" facs="#m-5cf94fe6-9297-4b81-88a0-073d053e93fc" label="lyrics-like">quem mittet Pater in nómine meo,</l><l xml:id="m-cbf57cd3-2039-42ce-b597-5f0ef4506015" facs="#m-a461892c-1683-4731-9901-e70e32a031e9" label="lyrics-like">ille vos docébit ómnia, et súggeret</l><l xml:id="m-a08ca9af-7cd6-431a-8593-3ae6a7d1b0a7" facs="#m-de7196ae-f2f8-4fd5-b854-23a32207784a" label="ambiguous">scat mundus, quia diligo Patrem,</l><l xml:id="m-68eae1fa-c6ab-4a8b-96df-bd2867bebf9f" facs="#m-2d73bbb1-fb80-4cc8-b195-837d068a21dc" label="lyrics-like">vobis ómnia, quaecúmque dixero! et sicut mandátum dedit mihi Pa¬</l><l xml:id="m-84561a9e-8fd3-4d79-9357-0ba0fb2b430d" facs="#m-ff071b4a-794d-423f-b7b2-1e8c9dfbea9e" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-d40d1161-19a8-4909-a9fe-ebdba5f6221d" facs="#m-8e23b836-dfc3-4910-b641-0834e6cac775" label="lyrics-like">vobis. Pacem relínquo vobis, pacem l ter, sic fácio.</l><l xml:id="m-58e89ad4-d61c-4ced-8e30-5376443c7dbe" facs="#m-124b88f3-5d07-487b-956a-d5ec69831d64" label="ambiguous">orert.</l><l xml:id="m-de402a47-2c4d-437e-bafc-f35766e1386f" facs="#m-311884ee-e66b-444f-bf59-9e56192efd37" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-f8c0e159-a11b-40ee-a63d-b44252491800" facs="#m-cef46782-91e1-43b0-b356-e9133fe7f806" label="lyrics-like">Onfírma “ hoc</l><l xml:id="m-d1be038e-61f3-4b1d-80fa-349e6348badf" facs="#m-c8ba0def-8fa4-4612-9196-8eb199f6acbe" label="lyrics-like">Dé-us,</l><l xml:id="m-a226be05-7788-46f7-b2e6-9c678c8547d2" facs="#m-95d5737e-528e-439d-a1ea-681c333b4663" label="lyrics-like">quod o- perá¬</l><l xml:id="m-6331a78c-434b-4273-be4a-83c284a56285" facs="#m-b5a56576-0e95-470e-82c2-e891686fa282" label="lyrics-like">tus es in nó¬ bis:</l><l xml:id="m-eac06205-8367-4857-bcb5-b0fd507a3856" facs="#m-f3ebfcf4-e982-4088-871f-989de5603c61" label="lyrics-like">a témplo tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-ae41bd95-8cba-49a8-97fe-3f58ce808cbc" facs="#m-4053a048-e0ce-471f-b9a8-f6eab8ddfa2c" label="ambiguous">o, quod</l><l xml:id="m-e5732fa7-7828-4537-8971-18a380847e9a" facs="#m-bb26be3e-ba34-4fa4-93a4-d069cd312bf4" label="lyrics-like">in Je-rú- sa-lem,</l><l xml:id="m-83b225cc-1b64-4088-8460-a37d8b45360a" facs="#m-3f504460-c26e-409c-89a2-37260a465ca0" label="ambiguous">est</l><l xml:id="m-5c63b327-80ef-4099-b6d7-3fb03349b33f" facs="#m-3e2c7a7b-9fa9-4240-a34d-e1288ef473df" label="lyrics-like">ti- bi óf- fe¬</l><l xml:id="m-de23c7f4-36fb-4b3b-94d1-83b18ecad79c" facs="#m-b8b4d948-0b52-4236-82d7-170ad5fa5811" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia</l><l xml:id="m-1e4ea939-a686-4a68-b170-b0d201c9521c" facs="#m-0f7c0e1b-6a09-4bd5-81a7-3cfa8aa2aa2d" label="ambiguous">al-le¬</l><l xml:id="m-6fef3ede-d3c8-4fa9-9735-1b4e10dcde95" facs="#m-1f391ae4-173a-40fb-90fd-6dde8e276f99" label="lyrics-like">rent ré¬ ges mú-ne¬ ra,</l><l xml:id="m-01cdaf2e-e1cf-4cbb-9926-55d498cf7147" facs="#m-61278be5-9f3e-42a7-a52e-4eb061dcee1d" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-34b4202b-750b-4d2f-88d1-1c3c1d0ebb4d" facs="#m-a419d8fa-65e0-4d95-a98c-a2f787865f84" label="lyrics-like">Unera, quaésumus Dómine,l emúnda. Per Dóminum... in unitáte</l><l xml:id="m-61f2e981-9c53-40b0-ae23-7d53df05624a" facs="#m-362a0b7f-b0d6-4b7c-9e65-ec3c687a3699" label="lyrics-like">JAt obláta sanctifica: et corda</l><l xml:id="m-ac545883-0600-4af4-80b2-77e2cdd691a3" facs="#m-aaa78fbb-1a16-434e-b899-085a18b2b4b5" label="lyrics-like">ejúsdem Spiritus.</l><l xml:id="m-3a6756a2-0b05-4927-a757-79e7bb69a7d3" facs="#m-e6fc3390-c1a9-4d6c-bcce-26f8e5f7c620" label="lyrics-like">nostra Sancti Spiritus illustratióne</l><l xml:id="m-65dfa07e-947d-4852-b203-3686d2bd92bf" facs="#m-5ea9feba-55a5-41a8-a2a1-23086f2daa9d" label="text-like">Preface of Pentecost, p. 9.</l><l xml:id="m-1d28bd0f-3bb8-40e5-9283-2f6ea2ed9efa" facs="#m-752133ac-e6c7-4467-8bb9-a235bd6844a5" label="ambiguous">Comm.</l><l xml:id="m-c8b117eb-8324-492f-b279-de530e171b80" facs="#m-2bf36bca-2933-4a09-905e-f916cc5fca77" label="ambiguous">7.</l><l xml:id="m-c946abc8-d54d-4917-ad81-57d6743acfa0" facs="#m-e74ac53b-f708-43ef-b6db-0da229ea09c0" label="ambiguous">F</l><l xml:id="m-48d63f0d-c915-4665-9b1b-ca8df691733e" facs="#m-d300692e-e466-488d-ace2-976668112e39" label="lyrics-like">Actus est * repénte de caélo só- nus</l><l xml:id="m-813d8f61-3749-4c33-9614-f0ac7a47e382" facs="#m-09db7f9e-adae-4156-b2bd-fb8f444c3836" label="lyrics-like">adveni-én¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
